Hello  I found an amazing video of 3.35 minutes(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l-Uup2lKw1Y) on youtube but for the sake answere my code will be:

In the view controller u are using 

    //suppose u are using the textfield label as this

      @IBOutlet weak var emailLabel: UITextField!
        @IBOutlet weak var passwordLabel: UITextField!

    //then ur viewdidload should have the code like this
    override func viewDidLoad() {
            super.viewDidLoad()

            self.emailLabel.delegate = self
            self.passwordLabel.delegate = self

        }

    //then u should implement the func named textFieldShouldReturn
     func textFieldShouldReturn(_ textField: UITextField) -> Bool {
            textField.resignFirstResponder()
            return true
        }

    // -- then to further if u want to close the keyboard when pressed somewhere else on the screen u can implement the following method too

    override func touchesBegan(_ touches: Set<UITouch>, with event: UIEvent?) {
            self.view.endEditing(true);
        }

I hope my answer helped u :)

