    - (void)loginWithCompletionBlock:(void (^)(BOOL success))completion
    {
        BOOL result = NO;

        // Do the login thing.

        completion(result);
    }

Calling it would be like so:

    [object loginWithCompletionBlock:^(BOOL success) {
        if (success) {
            // It worked
        } else {
            // Oh No!!
        }
    }];

Hope  this helps.

